k study that challenges the status quo — and why it’s been suppressed.\n• Watch the trailer, hear behind-the-scenes revelations, and understand why this story’s making waves.\n• Discover what Del has planned for Austin and how you can join this movement.\n• Bring your toughest questions — this is no ordinary interview!\n🗓️ Thursday, October 9\n⏰ 7 pm ET / 4 pm PT Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fwe2/f9/s8/1/y/2/A/o/y2Aoz.qR4e-small-Episode-198-An-Inconvenient.jpg", "display_id": "v6xs4po", "fulltitle": "Episode 198: An Inconvenient Study", "duration_string": "1:31:06", "upload_date": "20251007", "release_date": "20251009", "release_year": 2025, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777728075, "acodec": "aac", "vcodec": "none", "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fwe2/f9/s8/2/y/2/A/o/y2Aoz.Gaa.rec.aac", "format_id": "audio-192p", "tbr": 192, "filesize": 131188472, "width": 0, "height": 192, "protocol": "https", "ext": "aac", "audio_ext": "aac", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 192, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": 0.0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "audio-192p - audio only", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a6b6fe44a30458c1754ef064f354f04a84004", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}